tensorflow/lite: TF version for release_version.h in the CMake build.

Since TF 2.20 tensorflow/core/public/release_version.h requires TF_MAJOR_VERSION, TF_MINOR_VERSION,
TF_PATCH_VERSION and TF_VERSION_SUFFIX (#error without them); Bazel defines them, the CMake build of
tflite 2.20 does not. Backport of the later tflite: compile definitions of tensorflow-lite with the version
of this tag (2.20.0).

--- a/tensorflow/lite/CMakeLists.txt
+++ b/tensorflow/lite/CMakeLists.txt
@@ -749,6 +749,13 @@
   PUBLIC ${TFLITE_TARGET_PUBLIC_OPTIONS}
   PRIVATE ${TFLITE_TARGET_PRIVATE_OPTIONS}
 )
+target_compile_definitions(tensorflow-lite
+  PRIVATE
+    TF_MAJOR_VERSION=2
+    TF_MINOR_VERSION=20
+    TF_PATCH_VERSION=0
+    TF_VERSION_SUFFIX=""
+)
 add_library(${PROJECT_NAME}::tensorflowlite ALIAS tensorflow-lite)
 
 # The install targets.
